invariant: INV-5
file: src/pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: ch_rsa_key_from_pem stops signing with the ladder, so a key whose
  private exponent is wrong decodes, and a session that signs with the
  ladder sends a CertificateVerify no client accepts. test_written
  changes one bit of d.

--- old
    if (!signs(cpu, WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, key)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
    if (cpu == UINT32_MAX && !signs(cpu, WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, key)) {
        return 0;
    }
